    controller:    { primary:"Process Management, Drive for Results", secondary:"Planning, Priority Setting", stress:"Gaps: Developing Others, Listening", insight:"Operational excellence competencies are natural. People development and listening require deliberate practice." },
    specialist:    { primary:"Technical Learning, Intellectual Horsepower", secondary:"Problem Solving, Attention to Detail", stress:"Gaps: Influencing, Strategic Agility", insight:"Deep in domain competencies. Development edge: broadening influence beyond technical expertise." },
